# Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx: "{T}: Add {C}." Tapping it adds exactly one colorless mana, checked in the pool right after.

[Bot1 Deck]
Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx
Forest x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Activate(Ability: Add {C})
? Bot1.Mana = {C}

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Tapped = true
